OL,3,GNEWSACouncil trials pothole machine
OL,4,Arejected elsewhere
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new machine to repair potholes is
OL,7,Fbeing trialled by a council despite
OL,8,Fother authorities across the country
OL,9,Frejecting it.
OL,11,FSuffolk County Council - which is run
OL,12,Fby Reform UK - began trialling the
OL,13,FPothole Pro on Monday after it became
OL,14,Ffree on loan from JCB.
OL,16,FIn Leicestershire, the county council
OL,17,Fsaid the machine was not economical,
OL,18,Fbut since being taken over by Reform,
OL,19,Fit was once again trialling the machine
OL,20,Fwhile other councils had reported
OL,21,Fsuccess.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
