OL,3,GNEWSACouncil trials pothole machine
OL,4,Arejected elsewhere
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Suffolk County Council,
OL,7,FMichael Hadwen, said he had "declared
OL,8,Fwar on potholes" and it made sense to
OL,9,Ftrial it when it was free, but
OL,10,Fopposition parties voiced concerns on
OL,11,Fits suitability.
